                    r2_diligence_label:     `Diligence finding: NordCast's lead architect built 40% of the model and has no lock-in. Your response?`,
                    dil_reprice:            `Re-price / structure an earn-out tied to retention and synergy delivery`,
                    dil_retention:          `Hold the price but add deep retention & autonomy guarantees in the SPA`,
                    dil_ignore:             `Note it but proceed — the technology is what matters, not one person`,
