                    r4_stress_label:        `Stress event (18 months in): NordCast's lead architect resigns AND the rival tables a bid for your alliance partner. Your move?`,
                    stress_accelerate:      `Activate retention triggers & promote internal successors — accelerate the joint pod`,
                    stress_renegotiate:     `Renegotiate — restructure the deal/partnership terms to re-secure the capability`,
                    stress_pivot:           `Pivot mode — convert alliance to acquisition (or acqui-hire the remaining team)`,
                    stress_freeze:          `Hold steady — the plan is sound; standing firm signals confidence`,
